    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>260704</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ホント？助かるわ。
じゃああの右奥にいる
三つ子のお客様の注文とって来て</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Really!? Great! Then, can you cover the
back right table? There are three girls there.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>65</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>260872</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>終ったらアタシのところに戻って、
その注文を教えてね？
じゃあよろしくっ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Once you're done, just come back to me
and tell me what they ordered! Thanks!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>66</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>261308</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……それだけか？
そんくらいなら何でもねーじゃん</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...That's all? Alright, we
can do that in no time.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>10</SpeakerId>
      <Id>67</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>261476</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>とりあえず
すぐ行ってこよう？
右奥の、三つ子、だよね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Okay, so let's go. It's the
three girls at the back right.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>11</SpeakerId>
      <Id>68</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>261652</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>わりーけど、おれたち
バイトじゃないんだ。ごめんな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Nah, sorry, but we're
not looking for work.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>10</SpeakerId>
      <Id>69</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>261820</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>えぇ～
そそそ、そんなぁ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Really?
Oh, no...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
